          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Norwyn (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Prime (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Light Hope (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver PoV</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>mild on screen death</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Blood</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Blood Drinking</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Light Spinner and her very bad horrible no good decision making</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>she had decent reasons but this was not the path to take</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Casual Racism</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Racism</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Bloodborne Fusion</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Don't Have to Know Bloodborne (Video Game)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Inspired by Bloodborne (Video Game)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>what's that? more exposition? oh boy!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>no editing we die like meh</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Emotional Manipulation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Manipulation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alcohol Abuse/Alcoholism</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Drug Addiction</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Drug Use</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>look is she even Shadow Weaver if she isn't addicted to magic and alcohol?</rdf:li>
